  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening quality infrastructure for  energy efficiency</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">St&#xe4;rkung der Qualit&#xe4;tsinfrastruktur im Bereich Energieeffizienz</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Das nationale System der Qualit&#xe4;tsinfrastruktur, Sistema Nacional de la Calidad (SNC) f&#xf6;rdert die
Nutzung von national produzierten und/oder importierten energieeffizienten Elektroger&#xe4;ten.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable energy supply and increased energy efficiency in household appliances and industry are important policy issues in Ecuador. To date, services for compliance with energy efficiency requirements have not been sufficiently available. This is where the project comes in, contributing to more effective market monitoring in the interest of consumers and raising awareness of this issue in politics and among the public. The aim is to strengthen the quality infrastructure for the demand for services in the field of energy efficiency in Ecuador.
Essential measures to achieve the goal are divided into four main areas of action: the development of technical competencies for conformity assessment, the promotion of the national metrology institute in the topics of temperature, humidity and photometry, the increased exchange within the institutions of the national quality infrastructure on two selected products (refrigerators, light bulbs) and the sensitization of external actors in politics and society. 
Partners of the project are the Ecuadorian Ministry of Production MPCEIP, the National Institute for Standardization (INEN) and the Ecuadorian Accreditation Service (SAE). In addition, the project collaborates with private laboratories and companies, as well as with the Ministry of Energy. The location of these institutions is Quito, so the work of the project is concentrated in the capital, but companies in other parts of the country also participate in the activities.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Das nationale System der Qualit&#xe4;tsinfrastruktur, Sistema Nacional de la Calidad (SNC) f&#xf6;rdert die
Nutzung von national produzierten und/oder importierten energieeffizienten Elektroger&#xe4;ten.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The national system of quality infrastructure promotes the use of energy efficient electrical products both from national production and importation.</narrative>
  </description>
